cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Linvesther, please cite it as below."
title: "Linvesther: privacy-preserving, verifiable investment track records"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Linvesther is an open-source protocol for privacy-preserving, verifiable
  investment track records. It turns a real track record into public claims
  anyone can check, without publishing a balance, a position or a trade.
authors:
  - family-names: "Honorato de Souza"
    given-names: "Lucas"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LucasHonoratoDeSouza/Linvesther"
url: "https://linvesther.com"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - zero-knowledge proofs
  - track record
  - verifiable performance
  - RISC Zero
  - privacy
